---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/about.css';
import Footer from '../../components/footer.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/layout.astro';
---
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bio</title>

</head>

<Layout>

    <main class="about-page">
        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="img_about">
                <img
                        src="/foto_about.jpg"
                        alt="Ritratto di Nico Bonanno"
                        width="500"
                        height="500"
                />
            </div>

            <div class="bio">
                <p>
                    Born, raised, and still living in Novara, I grew up discovering a deep passion for the visual arts.
                    Particularly drawn to cinema and photography, I began taking the latter seriously during high school.
                    I started shooting with my mother's Nikon D5000, eventually moving on to a Fujifilm X-T50.<br><br>

                    At the same time, I found a sense of belonging in political and social activism,
                    eventually becoming a volunteer photographer for projects and events organised by Sermais and Libera Novara,
                    both of which I am actively involved in.<br><br>

                    Today, I continue to pursue this passion, driven by the desire to keep experimenting and learning. I remain open to every possibility the future may bring.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="about-credits">
            <p>
                Website developed by Davide Lanza.<br/>
                Epoch Font by Junhan Sim<br/>
                © Nico Bonanno
            </p>
        </div>

    </main>

</Layout>

